# Data
# The three sample documents (12KB of Markdown) are part of the project: the
# README, the quickstart and the evaluation harness all assume they are there,
# and `data/` swallowing them meant a clean clone had nothing to retrieve.
# Everything else under data/ — the Chroma index, the model cache — stays out.
data/*
!data/raw_data/
data/raw_data/*
!data/raw_data/*.md
*.db
*.sqlite

